{
  "name": "Homelab Status Aggregator (Proxmox + Portainer + Pi-hole -> Glance)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Glance Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        250,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "glance/homelab",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {},
        "authentication": "headerAuth"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        490,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "ea2abd06-958b-4e67-9129-7550f1cea5da",
              "name": "proxmoxHost",
              "value": "10.0.0.190:8006",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fa22af04-c7cb-47bf-982e-a3ba5a86ecf4",
              "name": "portainerHost",
              "value": "10.0.0.62:9443",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1ff9149-2923-4bfe-9c96-ae11de3767f4",
              "name": "endpointId",
              "value": "1",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "68de1816-2270-4815-b5f0-c978767c5309",
              "name": "piholeUrl",
              "value": "http://10.0.0.226",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "0c999ef7-dc98-4489-b203-7e8a179066a1",
              "name": "piholePassword",
              "value": "CHANGE_ME_APP_PASSWORD",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Proxmox Nodes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        730,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://{{ $('Config').first().json.proxmoxHost }}/api2/json/nodes",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "name": "Portainer Containers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        970,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://{{ $('Config').first().json.portainerHost }}/api/endpoints/{{ $('Config').first().json.endpointId }}/docker/containers/json?all=true",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "executeOnce": true
    },
    {
      "name": "Pi-hole Login",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1210,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.piholeUrl }}/api/auth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ password: $('Config').first().json.piholePassword }) }}",
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "executeOnce": true
    },
    {
      "name": "Pi-hole Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1450,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.piholeUrl }}/api/stats/summary",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-FTL-SID",
              "value": "={{ $('Pi-hole Login').first().json.session.sid }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "executeOnce": true
    },
    {
      "name": "Pi-hole Logout",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1690,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.piholeUrl }}/api/auth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-FTL-SID",
              "value": "={{ $('Pi-hole Login').first().json.session.sid }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "executeOnce": true
    },
    {
      "name": "Build Status JSON",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1930,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const px = $('Proxmox Nodes').first().json;\nconst containers = $('Portainer Containers').all().map(i => i.json).filter(c => c.Id);\nconst ph = $('Pi-hole Summary').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  generatedAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n  proxmox: px.data ? px.data.map(n => ({\n    node: n.node, status: n.status,\n    cpu: Math.round((n.cpu || 0) * 100),\n    mem: n.maxmem ? Math.round(n.mem / n.maxmem * 100) : null,\n    uptimeHours: Math.round((n.uptime || 0) / 3600),\n  })) : { error: px.error?.message || px.error || 'unreachable' },\n  containers: {\n    total: containers.length,\n    running: containers.filter(c => c.State === 'running').length,\n    stopped: containers.filter(c => c.State !== 'running').map(c => (c.Names?.[0] || c.Id).replace(/^\\//, '')),\n  },\n  pihole: ph.queries ? {\n    total: ph.queries.total, blocked: ph.queries.blocked,\n    percentBlocked: Math.round(ph.queries.percent_blocked * 10) / 10,\n  } : { error: ph.error?.message || ph.error || 'unreachable' },\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Note d755",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What changed\nThe 3 parallel branches never merged (Build ran 3 times with 1 item each). Calls are now sequential, each tolerates failure, and the result is served to Glance on request (Glance pulls; it has no push API).\n\n## Setup\n1. **Config**: hosts + Pi-hole app password.\n2. **Proxmox Nodes**: Header Auth `Authorization: PVEAPIToken=...` (Sys.Audit).\n3. **Portainer Containers**: Header Auth `X-API-Key: <token>`.\n4. **Glance Webhook**: Header Auth `X-Glance-Key`.\n5. Glance `custom-api` widget → `https://service.example.com/webhook/glance/homelab` with header `X-Glance-Key`.",
        "width": 1920,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 4
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Glance Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Config",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Config": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Proxmox Nodes",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Proxmox Nodes": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Portainer Containers",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Portainer Containers": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Pi-hole Login",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Pi-hole Login": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Pi-hole Summary",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Pi-hole Summary": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Pi-hole Logout",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Pi-hole Logout": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Build Status JSON",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
